        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1f92eaf403b776771ff9eb5d5289787fb6088b69dcfc845a4f84697a627fd3e3",
      "skos:note": "Consider seriousness, continuity, role, and other circumstances when assessing hostile workplace environments."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022#sch-1-sec-28m-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "28M(3) Hostile workplace environments",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 9,
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of subsection (2), the circumstances to be taken\ninto account include, but are not limited to, the following:\n\n(a) the seriousness of the conduct;\n\n(b) whether the conduct was continuous or repetitive;\n\n(c) the role, influence or authority of the person engaging in the\nconduct;\n\n(d) any other relevant circumstance."
    },
