      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\n; or (iii) subjecting a person to a workplace environment that is\nhostile on the ground of sex;\n\nPositive duty  Schedule 2\nDuty  Part 1\n\nNo. 85, 2022\nAnti-Discrimination and Human Rights Legislation Amendment\n(Respect at Work) Act 2022",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\n\n; or (iii) subjecting a person to a workplace environment that is\nhostile on the ground of sex;\n\nPositive duty  Schedule 2\nDuty  Part 1\n\nNo. 85, 2022\nAnti-Discrimination and Human Rights Legislation Amendment\n(Respect at Work) Act 2022",
      "cml:asserts": [
