    {
      "@id": "concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-2-sec-35a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "35A Functions of Commission relating to positive duty in relation to",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022#sch-2-sec-35a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022.pdf, p.15",
      "values:originalText": "sex discrimination\n\nThe following functions are conferred on the Commission:\n\n(a) to prepare, and to publish in such manner as the Commission\nconsiders appropriate, guidelines for complying with the\npositive duty in relation to sex discrimination;\n\n(b) to promote an understanding and acceptance, and the public\ndiscussion, of the positive duty in relation to sex\ndiscrimination;\n\n(c) to undertake research and educational programs in relation to\nthe positive duty in relation to sex discrimination;\n\nSchedule 2  Positive duty",
      "skos:definition": "sex discrimination\n\nThe following functions are conferred on the Commission:\n\n(a) to prepare, and to publish in such manner as the Commission\nconsiders appropriate, guidelines for complying with the\npositive duty in relation to sex discrimination;\n\n(b) to promote an understanding and acceptance, and the public\ndiscussion, of the positive duty in relation to sex\ndiscrimination;\n\n(c) to undertake research and educational programs in relation to\nthe positive duty in relation to sex discrimination;\n\nSchedule 2  Positive duty",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-2-sec-35a-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e012b9759821fecb36c89976a2caa58a9beb32cbab33c92b4d9214b172015456",
      "skos:note": "Commission's functions related to positive duty in relation to sex discrimination"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022#sch-2-sec-35a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "35A Functions of Commission relating to positive duty in relation to",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 15,
      "values:originalText": "sex discrimination\n\nThe following functions are conferred on the Commission:\n\n(a) to prepare, and to publish in such manner as the Commission\nconsiders appropriate, guidelines for complying with the\npositive duty in relation to sex discrimination;\n\n(b) to promote an understanding and acceptance, and the public\ndiscussion, of the positive duty in relation to sex\ndiscrimination;\n\n(c) to undertake research and educational programs in relation to\nthe positive duty in relation to sex discrimination;\n\nSchedule 2  Positive duty"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-2-sec-35a-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-2-sec-35a"
      },
