      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(3A) Notwithstanding paragraph (1)(da), the functions of the\nCommission do not include inquiring into an intelligence agency’s\ncompliance with the positive duty in relation to sex discrimination.\n\nPositive duty  Schedule 2\nCompliance  Part 2\n\nNo. 85, 2022\nAnti-Discrimination and Human Rights Legislation Amendment\n(Respect at Work) Act 2022\n\n(3B) If the President reasonably suspects that an intelligence agency is\nnot complying with the positive duty in relation to sex\ndiscrimination, the President must refer the matter to the\nInspector-General of Intelligence and Security.",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n\n(3A) Notwithstanding paragraph (1)(da), the functions of the\nCommission do not include inquiring into an intelligence agency’s\ncompliance with the positive duty in relation to sex discrimination.\n\nPositive duty  Schedule 2\nCompliance  Part 2\n\nNo. 85, 2022\nAnti-Discrimination and Human Rights Legislation Amendment\n(Respect at Work) Act 2022\n\n(3B) If the President reasonably suspects that an intelligence agency is\nnot complying with the positive duty in relation to sex\ndiscrimination, the President must refer the matter to the\nInspector-General of Intelligence and Security.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
