      "values:originalText": "(3A) Notwithstanding paragraph (1)(da), the functions of the\nCommission do not include inquiring into an intelligence agency’s\ncompliance with the positive duty in relation to sex discrimination.\n\nPositive duty  Schedule 2\nCompliance  Part 2\n\nNo. 85, 2022\nAnti-Discrimination and Human Rights Legislation Amendment\n(Respect at Work) Act 2022"
