    {
      "@id": "concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-2-sec-35c",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "35C Commission to notify person and give opportunity for making",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022#sch-2-sec-35c"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022.pdf, p.18",
      "values:originalText": "of submissions\n\n(1) As soon as practicable after commencing an inquiry into a person’s\ncompliance with the positive duty in relation to sex discrimination,\nthe Commission must give the person a written notice stating the\ngrounds on which the Commission commenced the inquiry.\n\n(2) The Commission must not find that a person is not complying with\nthe positive duty in relation to sex discrimination unless it has\ngiven a reasonable opportunity to the person, to do, at the option of\nthe person, either or both of the following:\n\n(a) to appear before the Commission, whether in person or by a\nrepresentative, and make oral submissions in relation to the\nperson’s compliance;\n\n(b) to make written submissions to the Commission in relation to\nthe person’s compliance.",
      "skos:definition": "of submissions\n\n(1) As soon as practicable after commencing an inquiry into a person’s\ncompliance with the positive duty in relation to sex discrimination,\nthe Commission must give the person a written notice stating the\ngrounds on which the Commission commenced the inquiry.\n\n(2) The Commission must not find that a person is not complying with\nthe positive duty in relation to sex discrimination unless it has\ngiven a reasonable opportunity to the person, to do, at the option of\nthe person, either or both of the following:\n\n(a) to appear before the Commission, whether in person or by a\nrepresentative, and make oral submissions in relation to the\nperson’s compliance;\n\n(b) to make written submissions to the Commission in relation to\nthe person’s compliance.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-2-sec-35c-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-2-sec-35c-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "158d79cb9377ec6ad89afd02fb10974d771e183d77410bd5b21f74c7ad61d4c2"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022#sch-2-sec-35c",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "35C Commission to notify person and give opportunity for making",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 18,
      "values:originalText": "of submissions\n\n(1) As soon as practicable after commencing an inquiry into a person’s\ncompliance with the positive duty in relation to sex discrimination,\nthe Commission must give the person a written notice stating the\ngrounds on which the Commission commenced the inquiry.\n\n(2) The Commission must not find that a person is not complying with\nthe positive duty in relation to sex discrimination unless it has\ngiven a reasonable opportunity to the person, to do, at the option of\nthe person, either or both of the following:\n\n(a) to appear before the Commission, whether in person or by a\nrepresentative, and make oral submissions in relation to the\nperson’s compliance;\n\n(b) to make written submissions to the Commission in relation to\nthe person’s compliance."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-2-sec-35c-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "35C(1) Commission to notify person and give opportunity for making",
