      "values:originalText": "(1) If, as a result of an inquiry into a person’s compliance with the\npositive duty in relation to sex discrimination, the Commission\nfinds that the person is not complying, the President may give the\nperson a written notice.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If, as a result of an inquiry into a person’s compliance with the\npositive duty in relation to sex discrimination, the Commission\nfinds that the person is not complying, the President may give the\nperson a written notice.",
      "values:partOf": {
