      },
      "dc:source": "anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022.pdf, p.20",
      "values:originalText": "(8) If the President’s functions under this section are performed by a\ndelegate of the President, the delegate who reconsiders a\ncompliance notice:\n\n(a) must not have been involved in giving the compliance notice;\nand\n\nPositive duty  Schedule 2\nCompliance  Part 2\n\nNo. 85, 2022\nAnti-Discrimination and Human Rights Legislation Amendment\n(Respect at Work) Act 2022\n\n(b) must hold a position, or perform duties, of at least the same\nlevel as the person who gave the compliance notice.",
      "skos:definition": "(8) If the President’s functions under this section are performed by a\ndelegate of the President, the delegate who reconsiders a\ncompliance notice:\n\n(a) must not have been involved in giving the compliance notice;\nand\n\nPositive duty  Schedule 2\nCompliance  Part 2\n\nNo. 85, 2022\nAnti-Discrimination and Human Rights Legislation Amendment\n(Respect at Work) Act 2022\n\n(b) must hold a position, or perform duties, of at least the same\nlevel as the person who gave the compliance notice.",
