      },
      "dc:source": "anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022.pdf, p.26",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The following functions are conferred on the Commission:\n\n(a) to inquire into any matter that may relate to systemic\nunlawful discrimination or suspected systemic unlawful\ndiscrimination;\n\n(b) to do anything incidental or conducive to the performance of\nany of the preceding functions.\n\n(2) In this Act:\nsystemic unlawful discrimination means unlawful discrimination\nthat:\n\n(a) affects a class or group of persons; and\n\n(b) is continuous, repetitive or forms a pattern.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The following functions are conferred on the Commission:\n\n(a) to inquire into any matter that may relate to systemic\nunlawful discrimination or suspected systemic unlawful\ndiscrimination;\n\n(b) to do anything incidental or conducive to the performance of\nany of the preceding functions.\n\n(2) In this Act:\nsystemic unlawful discrimination means unlawful discrimination\nthat:\n\n(a) affects a class or group of persons; and\n\n(b) is continuous, repetitive or forms a pattern.",
