      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "35P Commission to give opportunity for making of submissions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022#sch-3-sec-35p"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022.pdf, p.27",
      "values:originalText": "In an inquiry into a matter under this Division, the Commission\nmust not make an adverse finding about a person unless it has\ngiven a reasonable opportunity to the person, to do, at the option of\nthe person, either or both of the following:\n\n(a) to appear before the Commission, whether in person or by a\nrepresentative, and make oral submissions in relation to the\nmatter;\n\n(b) to make written submissions to the Commission in relation to\nthe matter.",
      "skos:definition": "In an inquiry into a matter under this Division, the Commission\nmust not make an adverse finding about a person unless it has\ngiven a reasonable opportunity to the person, to do, at the option of\nthe person, either or both of the following:\n\n(a) to appear before the Commission, whether in person or by a\nrepresentative, and make oral submissions in relation to the\nmatter;\n\n(b) to make written submissions to the Commission in relation to\nthe matter.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-3-sec-35p-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-3-sec-35p-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-3-sec-35p-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-3-sec-35p-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-3-sec-35p-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-3-sec-35p-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "eb4362db9bdd4b9f796e705535472206d7ac49e788b835555bf5dfca0aa6bcbf",
      "skos:note": "Commission must give a reasonable opportunity to a person to make submissions before making an adverse finding."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022#sch-3-sec-35p",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "35P Commission to give opportunity for making of submissions",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 27,
      "values:originalText": "In an inquiry into a matter under this Division, the Commission\nmust not make an adverse finding about a person unless it has\ngiven a reasonable opportunity to the person, to do, at the option of\nthe person, either or both of the following:\n\n(a) to appear before the Commission, whether in person or by a\nrepresentative, and make oral submissions in relation to the\nmatter;\n\n(b) to make written submissions to the Commission in relation to\nthe matter."
    },
