    {
      "@id": "concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-3-sec-35q",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "35Q Reports",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022#sch-3-sec-35q"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022.pdf, p.27",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If the Commission has undertaken an inquiry into a matter under\nthis Division, the Commission may do either or both of the\nfollowing:\n\n(a) report to the Minister in relation to the inquiry;\n\n(b) publish a report in relation to the inquiry.\n\n(2) The Commission may include in its report any recommendations\nby the Commission for addressing the matter.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If the Commission has undertaken an inquiry into a matter under\nthis Division, the Commission may do either or both of the\nfollowing:\n\n(a) report to the Minister in relation to the inquiry;\n\n(b) publish a report in relation to the inquiry.\n\n(2) The Commission may include in its report any recommendations\nby the Commission for addressing the matter.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-3-sec-35q-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-3-sec-35q-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "107b1580331a67671ee385a4186adb87021049cbffc049749402627b8d380784"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022#sch-3-sec-35q",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "35Q Reports",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 27,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If the Commission has undertaken an inquiry into a matter under\nthis Division, the Commission may do either or both of the\nfollowing:\n\n(a) report to the Minister in relation to the inquiry;\n\n(b) publish a report in relation to the inquiry.\n\n(2) The Commission may include in its report any recommendations\nby the Commission for addressing the matter."
    },
