      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(4A) In the case of a representative application, subsection (4) applies as\nif a reference to an applicant included a reference to a person on\nwhose behalf the application is made, other than one who has opted\nout under subsection 46POB(3).",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n\n(4A) In the case of a representative application, subsection (4) applies as\nif a reference to an applicant included a reference to a person on\nwhose behalf the application is made, other than one who has opted\nout under subsection 46POB(3).",
