    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022#sch-4-sec-8-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "8(2) After section 46PO",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 29,
      "values:originalText": "(2) A representative application must:\n\n(a) describe or otherwise identify the persons on whose behalf\nthe application is made; and\n\n(b) include a statement by the person making the application\ncertifying that each person on whose behalf the application is\nmade has consented, in writing, to the making of the\napplication on the person’s behalf; and\n\n(c) specify the nature of the relief sought.\n\nSchedule 4  Representative applications\n\nAnti-Discrimination and Human Rights Legislation Amendment\n(Respect at Work) Act 2022\nNo. 85, 2022\n\n46POB  Additional rules applying to representative applications\nSeparate applications may not be made"
    },
    {
