      "skos:note": "Court may fix another date to extend opt-out period."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022#sch-4-sec-8-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "8(4) After section 46PO",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 29,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The court concerned, on the application of the person who made\nthe application, a respondent or a person on whose behalf the\napplication is made, may fix another date so as to extend the period\nduring which a person may opt out of the proceeding."
    },
