    {
      "@id": "concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-6-sec-9",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "9 After subsection 13(3)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022#sch-6-sec-9"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022.pdf, p.34",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\nExclusion of operationally sensitive information etc.\n\n(3A) Subsection (3B) applies to a relevant employer that is a law\nenforcement or security agency (within the meaning of the\nIndependent National Security Legislation Monitor Act 2010).\n\n(3B) The relevant employer is not required to include in a public report\nany information:\n\nAmendment of the Workplace Gender Equality Act 2012  Schedule 6\n\nNo. 85, 2022\nAnti-Discrimination and Human Rights Legislation Amendment\n(Respect at Work) Act 2022\n\n(a) that is operationally sensitive information (within the\nmeaning of the Independent National Security Legislation\nMonitor Act 2010); or\n\n(b) the publication of which could prejudice the security, defence\nor international relations of Australia.",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\nExclusion of operationally sensitive information etc.\n\n(3A) Subsection (3B) applies to a relevant employer that is a law\nenforcement or security agency (within the meaning of the\nIndependent National Security Legislation Monitor Act 2010).\n\n(3B) The relevant employer is not required to include in a public report\nany information:\n\nAmendment of the Workplace Gender Equality Act 2012  Schedule 6\n\nNo. 85, 2022\nAnti-Discrimination and Human Rights Legislation Amendment\n(Respect at Work) Act 2022\n\n(a) that is operationally sensitive information (within the\nmeaning of the Independent National Security Legislation\nMonitor Act 2010); or\n\n(b) the publication of which could prejudice the security, defence\nor international relations of Australia.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-6-sec-9-ss-3a"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-6-sec-9-ss-3b"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "fea06cedb5f139aa8dc0ceacb0a9b5e8c0b872afe9bd44ee96069228fd5ce393"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022#sch-6-sec-9",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "9 After subsection 13(3)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 34,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\nExclusion of operationally sensitive information etc.\n\n(3A) Subsection (3B) applies to a relevant employer that is a law\nenforcement or security agency (within the meaning of the\nIndependent National Security Legislation Monitor Act 2010).\n\n(3B) The relevant employer is not required to include in a public report\nany information:\n\nAmendment of the Workplace Gender Equality Act 2012  Schedule 6\n\nNo. 85, 2022\nAnti-Discrimination and Human Rights Legislation Amendment\n(Respect at Work) Act 2022\n\n(a) that is operationally sensitive information (within the\nmeaning of the Independent National Security Legislation\nMonitor Act 2010); or\n\n(b) the publication of which could prejudice the security, defence\nor international relations of Australia."
    },
