      },
      "dc:source": "anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022.pdf, p.34",
      "values:originalText": "(3A) Subsection (3B) applies to a relevant employer that is a law\nenforcement or security agency (within the meaning of the\nIndependent National Security Legislation Monitor Act 2010).",
      "skos:definition": "(3A) Subsection (3B) applies to a relevant employer that is a law\nenforcement or security agency (within the meaning of the\nIndependent National Security Legislation Monitor Act 2010).",
