      "dc:source": "anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022.pdf, p.34",
      "values:originalText": "(3B) The relevant employer is not required to include in a public report\nany information:\n\nAmendment of the Workplace Gender Equality Act 2012  Schedule 6\n\nNo. 85, 2022\nAnti-Discrimination and Human Rights Legislation Amendment\n(Respect at Work) Act 2022\n\n(a) that is operationally sensitive information (within the\nmeaning of the Independent National Security Legislation\nMonitor Act 2010); or\n\n(b) the publication of which could prejudice the security, defence\nor international relations of Australia.",
      "skos:definition": "(3B) The relevant employer is not required to include in a public report\nany information:\n\nAmendment of the Workplace Gender Equality Act 2012  Schedule 6\n\nNo. 85, 2022\nAnti-Discrimination and Human Rights Legislation Amendment\n(Respect at Work) Act 2022\n\n(a) that is operationally sensitive information (within the\nmeaning of the Independent National Security Legislation\nMonitor Act 2010); or\n\n(b) the publication of which could prejudice the security, defence\nor international relations of Australia.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-6-sec-9"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
