      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(2A) A relevant employer that is a Commonwealth company or\nCommonwealth entity must prepare a public report in respect of\nthe period of 12 months commencing on 1 January 2022 and after\nthat, in respect of each consecutive period of 12 months.",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n\n(2A) A relevant employer that is a Commonwealth company or\nCommonwealth entity must prepare a public report in respect of\nthe period of 12 months commencing on 1 January 2022 and after\nthat, in respect of each consecutive period of 12 months.",
      "cml:asserts": [
