      "cof:title": "12 After subsection 13A(2)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 35,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(2A) A relevant employer that is a Commonwealth company or\nCommonwealth entity must prepare a public report in respect of\nthe period of 12 months commencing on 1 January 2022 and after\nthat, in respect of each consecutive period of 12 months."
    },
