      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-7-sec-17",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "17 Application—pre-commencement acts of victimisation",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022#sch-7-sec-17"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022.pdf, p.43",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nFor the purposes of subsection 47A(1) of the Age Discrimination Act\n2004 (as added by this Schedule):\n\n(a) it is immaterial whether the act was committed before, at or\nafter the commencement of this item; and\n\n(b) so far as that subsection relates to an act committed before\nthe commencement of this item, that subsection is modified\nby inserting “, and is taken to have been unlawful,” after\n“unlawful”.\n(2)\nFor the purposes of subsection 58A(1) of the Disability Discrimination\nAct 1992 (as added by this Schedule):\n\n(a) it is immaterial whether the act was committed before, at or\nafter the commencement of this item; and\n\n(b) so far as that subsection relates to an act committed before\nthe commencement of this item, that subsection is modified\nby inserting “, and is taken to have been unlawful,” after\n“unlawful”.\n(3)\nFor the purposes of subsection 18AA(1) of the Racial Discrimination\nAct 1975 (as added by this Schedule):\n\n(a) it is immaterial whether the act was committed before, at or\nafter the commencement of this item; and\n\n(b) so far as that subsection relates to an act committed before\nthe commencement of this item, that subsection is modified\nby inserting “, and is taken to have been unlawful,” after\n“unlawful”.",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nFor the purposes of subsection 47A(1) of the Age Discrimination Act\n2004 (as added by this Schedule):\n\n(a) it is immaterial whether the act was committed before, at or\nafter the commencement of this item; and\n\n(b) so far as that subsection relates to an act committed before\nthe commencement of this item, that subsection is modified\nby inserting “, and is taken to have been unlawful,” after\n“unlawful”.\n(2)\nFor the purposes of subsection 58A(1) of the Disability Discrimination\nAct 1992 (as added by this Schedule):\n\n(a) it is immaterial whether the act was committed before, at or\nafter the commencement of this item; and\n\n(b) so far as that subsection relates to an act committed before\nthe commencement of this item, that subsection is modified\nby inserting “, and is taken to have been unlawful,” after\n“unlawful”.\n(3)\nFor the purposes of subsection 18AA(1) of the Racial Discrimination\nAct 1975 (as added by this Schedule):\n\n(a) it is immaterial whether the act was committed before, at or\nafter the commencement of this item; and\n\n(b) so far as that subsection relates to an act committed before\nthe commencement of this item, that subsection is modified\nby inserting “, and is taken to have been unlawful,” after\n“unlawful”.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-7-sec-17-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-7-sec-17-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-7-sec-17-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022-sch-7-sec-17-logic-alleninterval-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "44c9f92e501ca5c9e8029f389fc1efb58c28e44f275b024f4ddf3ab71aeaf01b",
      "skos:note": "Acts committed before commencement are treated as unlawful."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/anti-discrimination-and-human-rights-legislation-amendment-respect-at-work-act-2022#sch-7-sec-17",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "17 Application—pre-commencement acts of victimisation",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 43,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nFor the purposes of subsection 47A(1) of the Age Discrimination Act\n2004 (as added by this Schedule):\n\n(a) it is immaterial whether the act was committed before, at or\nafter the commencement of this item; and\n\n(b) so far as that subsection relates to an act committed before\nthe commencement of this item, that subsection is modified\nby inserting “, and is taken to have been unlawful,” after\n“unlawful”.\n(2)\nFor the purposes of subsection 58A(1) of the Disability Discrimination\nAct 1992 (as added by this Schedule):\n\n(a) it is immaterial whether the act was committed before, at or\nafter the commencement of this item; and\n\n(b) so far as that subsection relates to an act committed before\nthe commencement of this item, that subsection is modified\nby inserting “, and is taken to have been unlawful,” after\n“unlawful”.\n(3)\nFor the purposes of subsection 18AA(1) of the Racial Discrimination\nAct 1975 (as added by this Schedule):\n\n(a) it is immaterial whether the act was committed before, at or\nafter the commencement of this item; and\n\n(b) so far as that subsection relates to an act committed before\nthe commencement of this item, that subsection is modified\nby inserting “, and is taken to have been unlawful,” after\n“unlawful”."
    },
